 border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q: Can I compare performance across different email types?</strong></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Yes, use the dropdown to filter by channel, and visually compare performance metrics.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Q: Are automated emails from triggers included?</strong></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Yes, emails sent through Workflow triggers are included and tracked.</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Next Steps</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Start planning campaigns using insights from top performers</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Customize filters to compare email performance by source</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Consider optimizing underperforming emails based on these metrics</p></li></ul><div class=\"attachment-thumb ember-view\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002139-managing-gbp-pages-additions-removals-adjustments", "title": "Managing GBP Pages: Additions, Removals, &amp; Adjustments", "folder": "Google Business Page", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403542/original/8q70GEgTiStrKEg-I7LTPHrWt9WjrpIirA5d8f.png?1711216244", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403557/original/u-iunMUeQP7y5LvurCtf4pXvk_wAuQEb-Q8642.png?1711216322", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403562/original/Ys_XYZxUMRLWCnOLTJ89iZxKdTiYpHvObA28b6.png?1711216377", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403575/original/hXTvEw34Z32pdSAIQyHRlHhvLHfHGKn5hwbff3.png?1711216420"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Learn how to effortlessly add or remove Google Business Profile pages and adjust GBP messaging and call tracking settings within your sub-account. This guide provides a simple step-by-step process to manage your GBP pages.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>Please note that the \"Manage Pages\" option is available only after the successful integration of GBP pages into your sub-account. To learn how to connect multiple GBP pages to a sub-account, <a href=\"155000002138.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">click here</a>.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br><strong dir=\"ltr\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Manage-Pages%3A\">Manage Pages</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Update-Settings%3A%C2%A0\">Update Settings</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Verify-Updates%3A-\">Verify Updates</a></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Manage-Pages:\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Manage Pages:</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">To add or remove pages or to change GBP messaging or call tracking options, click on 'Manage Pages'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403542/original/8q70GEgTiStrKEg-I7LTPHrWt9WjrpIirA5d8f.png?1711216244\" style=\"width: 325px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155023403542\"></p><h3 dir=\"ltr\"><br></h3><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Update-Settings:&nbsp;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Update Settings:</strong>&nbsp;</h3><p dir=\"ltr\">Make the necessary adjustments and click on 'Update' to apply the changes.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403557/original/u-iunMUeQP7y5LvurCtf4pXvk_wAuQEb-Q8642.png?1711216322\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155023403557\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br>Note: The changes made at the page level do not impact previous data or records and only affect data on a going-forward basis based on the changes.</p><h3 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Verify-Updates:-\"><br><strong>Verify Updates:&nbsp;</strong></h3><p dir=\"ltr\">Click on the 'Refresh' icon to check the update status of the connection.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403562/original/Ys_XYZxUMRLWCnOLTJ89iZxKdTiYpHvObA28b6.png?1711216377\" style=\"width: 373px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155023403562\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Upon successful connection, the details of the updated pages will be displayed in the GBP section.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155023403575/original/hXTvEw34Z32pdSAIQyHRlHhvLHfHGKn5hwbff3.png?1711216420\" style=\"width: 376px;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155023403575\"></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000757", "title": "The page you were looking for doesn't exist.", "folder": "", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": ""}, {"slug": "155000000623-how-to-enable-lc-email-validation", "title": "How to enable LC Email Validation", "folder": "LeadConnector Email", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155038696114/original/T0Q4fOg65-hk4Fx9RJ0rLuI7uiERh6X9ugdb70.png?1734699091", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155003776708/original/R1rozYmn