r-box;\"></p><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Bot Goals</strong></h2><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Stop Bot - When the condition in this goal is reached.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565038/original/k-mPcbi9HvhF3ZrayhYLqKIGyyIaCwfsrg76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 0px 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155055565038\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Appointment Booking &gt; Post Appointment Booked - after an appointment is successfully booked.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565034/original/dJYDy-QFXjKZXkGemo9DCLU2cCFmQ4scJg76b5.png?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565034\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Human Handover - When the goal is reached and the conversation calls in a human.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Bot Goals &gt; Transfer Bot - When the condition is triggered to switch to a different bot.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565036/original/JcCjM_G_RmA8K7a2oIPwRwFlEbDr05sy_g76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565036\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li></ul><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Conversation</strong></h2><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Conversation &gt; Manual Input - When a human user sends a message in the conversation.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565035/original/T3dcRQ0PQ_d_qbB-dJd_UKU2djTIutZGKw76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565035\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Conversation &gt; Manual Switch to Inactive - In the Conversations panel, manually switch the Conversation AI from Active to Inactive.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055565037/original/ibsnq8rel7S5iGJHCJLzjDgG-O3S10R8ng76b5.jpg?1759968854\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155055565037\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></li></ul><hr><p></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Workflow</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Workflow &gt; Action - When a workflow action sets the conversation to inactive/sleep.</li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Workflow &gt; Message Sent - When a workflow sends a message in the conversation.</li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006431-what-is-shaken-stir-", "title": "What is SHAKEN/STIR?", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676283/original/iz5qKejeMvqBse0VPGcbyns0UYzZfktSMg7954.png?1758888902", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676222/original/bsGNMJlkxLcctHc3E5tTqXm1O95wE2SP-web1c.png?1758888859", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676355/original/FYHtCyyTsiW8vYmgq3fezgy6zTmTFja3ow7dc4.png?1758888981"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h2 data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"239\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Overview</strong></span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-end=\"540\" data-start=\"265\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">SHAKEN/STIR is a set of protocols designed to authenticate caller ID information and verify that it is coming from a legitimate source. It uses <strong data-end=\"433\" data-start=\"409\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">digital certificates</strong> to validate your ownership of the phone number, ensuring carriers can trust that your calls are genuine.</p><p data-end=\"666\" data-start=\"542\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">When enabled, your calls are more likely to display as a <strong data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"599\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">\u201cTrusted Call\u201d</strong>, improving the chance that recipients pick up.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"bold\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; border: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; display: inline; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR</strong> r<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(32, 32, 32); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">egistration helps you increase the call completion and call answer rates by verifying your ownership of the phone number.</span></div><p data-end=\"666\" data-start=\"542\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676283/original/iz5qKejeMvqBse0VPGcbyns0UYzZfktSMg7954.png?1758888902\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155054676283\"></p><h2 data-end=\"701\" data-start=\"673\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Why SHAKEN/STIR Matters</span></strong></h2><ul data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"702\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"702\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"747\" data-start=\"704\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Boosts call completion and answer rates</p></li><li data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"748\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"796\" data-start=\"750\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Helps prevent caller ID spoofing and fraud</p></li><li data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"797\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"855\" data-start=\"799\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">May display a \u201cTrusted Call\u201d label on outgoing calls</p></li><li data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"856\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"858\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Does not remove nuisance labels</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"917\" data-start=\"900\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Requirements</strong></span></h2><ul data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"918\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"918\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1008\" data-start=\"920\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">An <strong data-end=\"963\" data-start=\"923\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">EIN (Employer Identification Number)</strong> is mandatory for SHAKEN/STIR registration.</p></li><li data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1009\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1116\" data-start=\"1011\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the <strong data-end=\"1105\" data-start=\"1083\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/155000005891-remediate-spam-likely-on-your-caller-id-using-free-caller-registry\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\"></a>Free call registry</strong> instead.</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"1153\" data-start=\"1123\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">How to Enable SHAKEN/STIR</span></strong></h2><ol data-end=\"1615\" data-start=\"1154\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1154\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1201\" data-start=\"1157\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1157\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">If you already registered for A2P SMS</strong>:</p><ul data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1205\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"1274\" data-start=\"1205\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1274\" data-start=\"1207\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Your phone numbers are <strong data-end=\"1256\" data-start=\"1230\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">automatically enrolled</strong> in SHAKEN/STIR.</p></li><li data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1278\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1280\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This applies to all new A2P applications submitted after <strong data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1337\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">April 23, 2025</strong>, and older sub-accounts are also being updated automatically.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676222/original/bsGNMJlkxLcctHc3E5tTqXm1O95wE2SP-web1c.png?1758888859\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155054676222\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p></li></ul></li><li data-end=\"1615\" data-start=\"1421\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1469\" data-start=\"1424\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong data-end=\"1466\" data-start=\"1424\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">If you have not registered for A2P SMS</strong>:</p><ul data-end=\"1615\" data-start=\"1473\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1473\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1566\" data-start=\"1475\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">You can manually enable SHAKEN/STIR for your numbers now from trust centre<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054676355/original/FYHtCyyTsiW8vYmgq3fezgy6zTmTFja3ow7dc4.png?1758888981\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155054676355\"></p></li></ul></li></ol><h2 data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1622\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Benefits at a Glance</span></strong></h2><div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><table class=