interest) to your&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Google Business Profile</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;pages\u2014giving customers more familiar ways to reach you and creating additional paths for engagement and lead capture. </span></span></p><blockquote data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"521\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><p data-end=\"633\" data-start=\"523\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">\u2705 <strong data-end=\"539\" data-start=\"525\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Important:</strong> The <strong data-end=\"592\" data-start=\"544\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Conversations module only supports messaging</strong> for channels <strong data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"606\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">integrated through CRM</strong>.</span></span></p></blockquote><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></span></span></p><ul style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"#How-to-connect-social-channels-with-GBP?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How to connect social channels with GBP?</a></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"#Supported-URL-formats-for-social-channels%3A\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Supported URL formats for social channels:</a></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a href=\"#How-will-these-channels-be-displayed?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How will these channels be displayed?</a></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Text/Whatsapp-message-option-is-not-visible-on-GBP-results%3A\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Text/Whatsapp message option is not visible on GBP results</a></span></span></li></ul><h2 id=\"How-to-connect-social-channels-with-GBP?\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">How to connect social channels with GBP?</span></span></span></h2><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-inden