?1753074846\" style=\"width: 608px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155050129936\">Step 5: Click on connect.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050129929/original/qz_mUO_Hw9iLiHn1p7xxozJ1AEkJf7EVeg5f0e.png?1753074828\" style=\"width: 606px; max-width: 100%; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered\" data-id=\"155050129929\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Supported-URL-formats-for-social-channels:\" style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Supported URL formats for social channels:</span></span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(31, 31, 31); font-weight: 400; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Social media links in Google Business Profile should respect the below formats.</span></span></span></p><div align=\"left\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-left: 0pt; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span><table style=\"border: none; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><colg