k: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"766\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"767\" data-sourcepos=\"14:3-14:97\" id=\"Does-the-Do-Not-Disturb-(DND)-setting-affect-other-communication-channels-or-just-WhatsApp?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont); margin-left: 0px; word-break: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"768\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Does the Do Not Disturb (DND) setting affect other communication channels or just WhatsApp?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"769\" data-sourcepos=\"14:3-14:97\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\">You can configure DND to apply to all channels or just WhatsApp. This gives you control over whether you want to prevent the customer from receiving communications across all methods or just on the particular channel where they requested to be left alone.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"770\" data-sourcepos=\"14:3-14:97\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"771\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"772\" data-sourcepos=\"11:3-11:126\" id=\"What's-the-difference-between-&quot;None---Manual-Text&quot;-and-selecting-a-template-when-sending-WhatsApp-messages-in-workflows?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont); margin-left: 0px; word-break: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"773\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What's the difference between \"None - Manual Text\" and selecting a template when sending WhatsApp messages in workflows?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"774\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\">\"None - Manual Text\" lets you write a free-form message within the 24-hour window. Selecting a template is for sending pre-approved messages, which is useful for starting conversations outside of the 24-hour window or for specific marketing or support purposes.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"781\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"784\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Can-I-use-WhatsApp-workflow-automation-to-send-messages-outside-the-24-hour-window?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont);\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"785\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Can I use WhatsApp workflow automation to send messages outside the 24-hour window?</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"786\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"787\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"788\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\">Yes, you can use approved WhatsApp templates after the initial 24-hour window for outreach or follow-up messages. Keep in mind that these template-based messages will incur additional charges.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"789\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"790\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"791\" data-sourcepos=\"20:3-20:99\" id=\"What's-a-'Free-Entry-Point-Conversation'-and-how-is-it-different-from-a-regular-conversation?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont); margin-left: 0px; word-break: break-word;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"792\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What's a 'Free Entry Point Conversation' and how is it different from a regular conversation?</strong></h2><ul data-identifyelement=\"793\" data-sourcepos=\"21:5-24:0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 2rem; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: var(--fw-textColor); padding-inline-start: 1.125rem; font-size: 16px !important;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"794\" data-sourcepos=\"21:5-21:100\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Triggered when a customer clicks a \"Click to WhatsApp\" ad or a Facebook Call-to-Action button.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"795\" data-sourcepos=\"22:5-22:66\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Lasts for 72 hours, compared to the standard 24-hour window.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"796\" data-sourcepo