pdown list when setting up the workflow.</p><p data-end=\"852\" data-start=\"708\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"854\" id=\"What-happens-if-I-select-the-wrong-phone-number?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont);\"><strong data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"859\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">What happens if I select the wrong phone number?</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"917\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\">If you select an incorrect number, the messages will be sent from that number. To fix this, edit the workflow and choose the correct phone number.</p><p data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"917\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: var(--fw-textColor);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-end=\"1136\" data-start=\"1067\" id=\"Do-I-need-to-configure-this-setting-for-every-workflow?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; font-size: 1.5em; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: var(--fw-headingsFont);\"><strong data-end=\"1134\" data-start=\"1072\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">Do I need to configure this setting for every workflow?</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word