-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046357740/original/YdvqtbEv4VyrDvjx418KNEHWyCq2X5jr-g4ec1.png?1746764900\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fw-lightbox-img\" data-id=\"155046357740\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; max-width: 100%; width: 605px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; font-size: inherit !important; height: auto !important;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Step 2: Select Accounts &gt;&gt; pages section under side navigation, Confirm if the user is added in people and has access of full control.<span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046357736/original/qAyflHbP90HN8qREsOxl7yZchX7CEzOTfg4ec1.png?1746764900\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fw-lightbox-img\" data-id=\"155046357736\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; max-width: 100%; width: 613px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; font-size: inherit !important; height: auto !important;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;Step 3: Go to integrations &gt;&gt; Lead access from side navigation, verify if lead connector is connected under CRM</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155046357738/original/mGKVEytxUIiNLQF3gR-7GBDKOc3J9vXC3w4ec1.png?1746764900\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fw-lightbox-img\" data-id=\"155046357738\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; max-width: 100%; width: 617px; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; font-size: inherit !important; height: auto !important;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><h1 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 2em; line-height: 43.75px; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Other facebook/instagram related support guides:</h1><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; 